# @etzianco/* packages (the design system) come from GitHub Packages. The
# token is never stored here: npm reads NODE_AUTH_TOKEN (set from `gh auth
# token` on the dev machine; `ez new` and `make` do it for you).
@etzianco:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
